  "articleHtml": "<main>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     At Chipotle, your ingredients are your nutrition facts.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A burrito with white rice, black beans, chicken, cheese, sour cream, and guacamole has a very different nutrition profile from a bowl built with greens, steak, fajita vegetables, and salsa.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Use the\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Chipotle Nutrition Calculator above\n    </span>\n<span>\n     to add the ingredients you actually order and see the combined calories, protein, carbohydrates, fat, sodium, fiber, and other available nutrition values.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.ya4g8yuq3qtz\">\n<span>\n     Burrito or Bowl? The Tortilla Makes a Real Difference\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A burrito and burrito bowl can contain exactly the same fillings, but the burrito adds a large flour tortilla.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Chipotle's standard burrito tortilla contains about\n    </span>\n<span>\n     320 calories\n    </span>\n<span>\n     , along with carbohydrates, fat, and sodium.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A bowl removes that tortilla from the starting point, but that does not automatically make every bowl low in calories. Rice, double protein, cheese, sour cream, queso, and guacamole can still create a substantial meal.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The best comparison is therefore not simply \u201cburrito vs bowl.\u201d Compare the ingredients inside each one.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.n12ypvijkriv\">\n<span>\n     Build the Calories Ingredient by Ingredient\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Chipotle makes this especially easy because most of the menu is assembled from individual components.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A practical way to calculate your order is:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Entr\u00e9e format \u2192 rice \u2192 beans \u2192 protein \u2192 salsa \u2192 toppings \u2192 extras\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For example, begin with a burrito tortilla or bowl, then add your chosen rice and beans. After that, select your protein, salsa, cheese, sour cream, guacamole, queso, or vegetables.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Every selection contributes independently to the final total.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     This makes ingredient-level calculation more useful than relying on an average \u201cChipotle bowl calories\u201d number.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.aw1tg0xzvhui\">\n<span>\n     Rice and Beans Change Both Carbs and Fiber\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Chipotle's Cilantro-Lime White Rice and Brown Rice are both about\n    </span>\n<span>\n     210 calories per standard serving\n    </span>\n<span>\n     , but their carbohydrate and fiber profiles are not identical.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Black Beans and Pinto Beans add carbohydrates too, while also contributing protein and dietary fiber.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If you order both rice and beans, count both. If you ask for extra portions, your actual meal can contain more than the standard values displayed for one serving.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For a more accurate estimate, build the bowl as closely as possible to the portions you receive.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.nnl9vc9y9fr\">\n<span>\n     Protein Choice Changes More Than Protein\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Chicken, steak, barbacoa, carnitas, Sofritas, and limited-time proteins each have their own calorie and macro profiles.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For example, standard Chipotle chicken provides more protein per serving than Sofritas, while carnitas naturally contain more fat than some of the leaner protein choices.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Chipotle also rotates limited-time proteins. In 2026,\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Chipotle Honey Chicken\n    </span>\n<span>\n     returned to the menu, while Chicken al Pastor also returned earlier in the year.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     When a seasonal protein is available, use its own nutrition entry rather than substituting standard chicken.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.jbugl2y3o8z\">\n<span>\n     Guacamole and Queso Need to Be Counted Separately\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Guacamole and Queso Blanco can make a noticeable difference to the total meal.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A standard serving of guacamole is about\n    </span>\n<span>\n     230 calories\n    </span>\n<span>\n     . Queso Blanco nutrition depends on whether you are looking at an entr\u00e9e portion or a larger side portion.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     This serving-size distinction matters.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If you add guacamole inside your bowl and also order chips and guacamole on the side, those are separate portions and should not be counted as one.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.6j1owzwcbnb2\">\n<span>\n     Salsa Is Not Just About Calories\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Chipotle's salsas are relatively modest in calories, but their sodium values can differ considerably.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Fresh Tomato Salsa, Roasted Chili-Corn Salsa, Tomatillo-Green Chili Salsa, and Tomatillo-Red Chili Salsa each have a different nutrition profile.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If you are comparing a meal by sodium rather than calories alone, the specific salsa can therefore matter.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The same is especially true for the\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Chipotle-Honey Vinaigrette\n    </span>\n<span>\n     , which contributes its own calories, fat, carbohydrates, sugar, and sodium and should be included when you use it with a salad or bowl.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.1o9x5f5qoy1a\">\n<span>\n     Double Protein Means Double the Protein Portion\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If you order double chicken, double steak, or another double protein, do not calculate it using a single serving.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Add the protein portion twice.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     This increases protein, but also increases the calories, fat, sodium, and other nutrients associated with that protein.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Chipotle has increasingly highlighted high-protein combinations and currently offers protein-focused menu options, but the complete nutrition still depends on everything else added to the entr\u00e9e.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.3vagz122d4cb\">\n<span>\n     Chips Can Change the Order More Than Expected\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A standard serving of Chipotle chips contains about\n    </span>\n<span>\n     540 calories\n    </span>\n<span>\n     .\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     That means:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Bowl only\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     and\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Bowl + chips + guacamole\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     are very different orders nutritionally, even though the bowl itself has not changed.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Chips with Queso Blanco or guacamole should therefore be calculated as a separate side rather than assumed to be part of the entr\u00e9e nutrition.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.kliaklxddcv2\">\n<span>\n     Tacos Need the Correct Tortilla Count\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Chipotle tacos can use crispy corn or soft flour tortillas.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The nutrition depends on both the tortilla type and the number of tacos you eat.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If you order three tacos, make sure the tortilla quantity and fillings reflect all three rather than calculating nutrition for only one taco.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The fillings matter too. Three tacos with chicken, cheese, and sour cream will not have the same total as three tacos filled with Sofritas, vegetables, and salsa.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.8dluo5ap6nvd\">\n<span>\n     Chipotle Nutrition Questions\n    </span>\n</h2><div class=\"faq-accordion-container space-y-3 my-6\"><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>How many calories are in a Chipotle bowl?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>How many calories does the Chipotle burrito tortilla add?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>How many calories are in Chipotle chicken?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>How many calories are in Chipotle guacamole?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Is a Chipotle bowl always lower in calories than a burrito?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>How should I calculate double protein?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details></div>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.4nu9ld2x63fj\">\n<span>\n     Build Your Actual Chipotle Order\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Chipotle nutrition is most useful when you calculate the meal ingredient by ingredient.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Start with the\n    </span>\n<span>\n     burrito, bowl, tacos, or salad\n    </span>\n<span>\n     , then add the exact\n    </span>\n<span>\n     rice, beans, protein, salsa, toppings, guacamole, queso, vinaigrette, chips, and drink\n    </span>\n<span>\n     you order.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     That produces a much more meaningful result than using one generic calorie number for a Chipotle meal.\n    </span>\n</p>\n</main>",
  "seoTitle": "Chipotle Nutrition Calculator: Calories & Macros",
  "seoDescription": "Calculate Chipotle calories, protein, carbs, fat, and sodium for burritos, bowls, tacos, rice, beans, proteins, salsa, guacamole, queso, chips, and more."
